[Prontera, the Capital of Rune-Midgarts Kingdom]
There are major buildings including
the Prontera Palace where job change to Crusader is available;
Prontera Cathedral where job changes to Acolyte, Priest are available
and wedding ceremonies are held;
the Knight's Building, etc.
